---

<Layout title="Esteban Soto Salguero | SysAdmin y DevOps">
  <main>
    <section id="inicio" class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10 px-6 pb-[5.25rem] pt-14 text-center sm:py-36">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 h-72 w-[min(90%,_58rem)] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-[45%] bg-cyan-400/10 blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="hero-intro relative mx-auto max-w-5xl">
        <div class="hero-profile-photo" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="hero-profile-photo-glow"></span>
          <img src={profilePhoto.src} alt="" width="270" height="270" />
        </div>
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-cyan-300">Hola, soy</p>
          <h1 class="mt-5 whitespace-nowrap text-[clamp(1.05rem,8vw,4.5rem)] font-bold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white">
            Esteban Soto Salguero<span class="text-cyan-300">.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Soy </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-baseline text-left font-medium text-cyan-300" aria-live="polite">
              <span id="profession">Junior SysAdmin</span><span class="cursor-blink ml-0.5" aria-hidden="true">|</span>
            </span>
          </p>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl leading-7 text-slate-400">
            Me preparo para impulsar infraestructuras fiables, automatizar procesos y facilitar despliegues
            seguros como Junior SysAdmin o Junior DevOps.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="sobre-mi" class="border-b border-white/10 px-6 py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cyan-300">Conóceme</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Sobre mí</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 max-w-4xl space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-slate-400">
          <p>
            Soy Esteban Soto Salguero, una persona curiosa y orientada a la resolución de problemas,
            con especial interés por la administración de sistemas, la automatización y las prácticas
            DevOps. Me gusta entender cómo funcionan las cosas desde la base, documentar cada proceso
            y convertir tareas repetitivas en flujos claros, seguros y fáciles de mantener.
          </p>
          <p>
            En mi aprendizaje combino la perspectiva de sistemas con la del desarrollo web: trabajo con
            Linux, redes, contenedores, control de versiones y herramientas de despliegue, sin perder de
            vista la experiencia de las personas que utilizarán cada solución. Busco seguir creciendo en
            entornos donde pueda aportar responsabilidad, atención al detalle y ganas de aprender.
          </p>
          <p>
            Mi objetivo es construir infraestructuras estables y automatizadas, anticiparme a los
            problemas y colaborar para que los proyectos lleguen a producción de una manera reproducible,
            observable y sostenible.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="formacion" class="border-b border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] px-6 py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cyan-300">Trayectoria</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Formación</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-2">
          {studies.map((study) => (
            <article class="tilt-card group relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6" data-tilt>
              <div class="tilt-shine pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
              <div class="relative">
                <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-300">{study.period}</p>
                <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">{study.title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">{study.description}</p>
                <div class="mt-6">
                  <h4 class="mb-3 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500">Módulos</h4>
                  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    {study.modules.map((module) => (
                      <span class="study-module rounded-full border border-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400">
                        {module}
                      </span>
                    ))}
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="experiencia" class="px-6 py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cyan-300">Trayectoria</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Experiencia</h2>

        <div class="mt-10 space-y-12">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Experiencia personal</h3>
            <div class="mt-6 grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-2">
              {projects.map((project) => (
                <article class="tilt-card group relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6" data-tilt>
                  <div class="tilt-shine pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
                  <div class="relative">
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold">{project.title}</h4>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">{project.description}</p>
                    <div class="mt-6">
                      <h5 class="mb-3 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500">Tecnologías</h5>
                      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        {project.technologies.map((technology) => (
                          <span class="study-module rounded-full border border-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400">
                            {technology}
                          </span>
                        ))}
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <a href={project.url} class="mt-5 inline-block text-cyan-300 transition-colors hover:text-cyan-200">
                      Ver proyecto <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </article>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Experiencia profesional</h3>
            {professionalExperience.length > 0 ? (
              <div class="mt-6 grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-2">
                {professionalExperience.map((experience) => (
                  <article class="tilt-card group relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6" data-tilt>
                    <div class="tilt-shine pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
                    <div class="relative">
                      <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold">{experience.title}</h4>
                      <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">{experience.description}</p>
                    </div>
                  </article>
                ))}
              </div>
            ) : (
              <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate-400">
                Próximamente añadiré aquí mi experiencia profesional y las responsabilidades desarrolladas en cada puesto.
              </p>
            )}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="tecnologias" class="border-t border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] px-6 py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cyan-300">Herramientas</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Tecnologías</h2>
        <div class="mt-10 space-y-10">
          {technologyGroups.map((group) => (
            <div>
              <h3 class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-400">{group.name}</h3>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                {group.technologies.map((technology) => (
                  <span class={`inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg ${technology.color}`}>
                    <span
                      aria-hidden="true"
                      class="technology-icon h-5 w-5 shrink-0 bg-current"
                      style={`--icon-url: url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@latest/icons/${technology.icon}.svg)`}
                    ></span>
                    {technology.name}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="roadmap" class="border-t border-white/10 px-6 py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cyan-300">Próximos objetivos</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Roadmap y Certificaciones</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate-400">
          Un recorrido vivo de las certificaciones que ya he completado y de los próximos objetivos
          que estoy preparando.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-2">
          {certifications.map((certification) => (
            <article
              class:list={[
                "tilt-card group relative rounded-2xl border p-6",
                certification.progress === 100
                  ? "border-emerald-400/30 bg-emerald-400/[0.04]"
                  : "border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03]"
              ]}
              data-tilt
            >
              <div class="tilt-shine pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
              <div class="relative">
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
                  <div>
                    <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-300">{certification.issuer}</p>
                    <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">{certification.title}</h3>
                  </div>
                  <span
                    class:list={[
                      "shrink-0 rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium",
                      certification.progress === 100
                        ? "border-emerald-400/30 bg-emerald-400/10 text-emerald-300"
                        : certification.progress === 0
                          ? "border-slate-400/20 bg-slate-400/10 text-slate-400"
                          : "border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/10 text-amber-300"
                    ]}
                  >
                    {certification.status}
                  </span>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-7">
                  <div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
                    <span>Progreso</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-slate-200">{certification.progress}%</span>
                  </div>
                  <div
                    class="h-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-800"
                    role="progressbar"
                    aria-label={`Progreso de ${certification.title}`}
                    aria-valuenow={certification.progress}
                    aria-valuemin="0"
                    aria-valuemax="100"
                  >
                    <div
                      class:list={[
                        "h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-700",
                        certification.progress === 100
                          ? "bg-emerald-400"
                          : "bg-cyan-400"
                      ]}
                      style={`width: ${certification.progress}%`}
                    ></div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <a
                  href={certification.pdf}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300 transition-colors hover:border-cyan-300/40 hover:bg-cyan-300/10 hover:text-cyan-200"
                >
                  Ver certificación PDF <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  const professionElement = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#profession");
  const professions = ["Junior SysAdmin", "Junior DevOps"];
  const reducedMotion = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;

  if (professionElement && !reducedMotion) {
    let professionIndex = 0;
    let characterIndex = professionElement.textContent?.length ?? 0;
    let deleting = true;
    const animateProfession = () => {
      const currentProfession = professions[professionIndex];
      professionElement.textContent = currentProfession.slice(0, characterIndex);
      if (deleting) {
        characterIndex -= 1;
        if (characterIndex < 0) {
          deleting = false;
          professionIndex = (professionIndex + 1) % professions.length;
          characterIndex = 0;
        }
      } else {
        characterIndex += 1;
        if (characterIndex > currentProfession.length) {
          deleting = true;
          window.setTimeout(animateProfession, 2200);
          return;
        }
      }
      window.setTimeout(animateProfession, deleting ? 120 : 180);
    };
    window.setTimeout(animateProfession, 2200);
  }

  if (!reducedMotion) {
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-tilt]").forEach((card) => {
      card.addEventListener("pointermove", (event) => {
        const bounds = card.getBoundingClientRect();
        const rotateX = ((event.clientY - bounds.top) / bounds.height - 0.5) * -6;
        const rotateY = ((event.clientX - bounds.left) / bounds.width - 0.5) * 6;
        card.style.setProperty("--rotate-x", `${rotateX}deg`);
        card.style.setProperty("--rotate-y", `${rotateY}deg`);
        card.style.setProperty("--shine-x", `${event.clientX - bounds.left}px`);
        card.style.setProperty("--shine-y", `${event.clientY - bounds.top}px`);
      });
      card.addEventListener("pointerleave", () => {
        card.style.setProperty("--rotate-x", "0deg");
        card.style.setProperty("--rotate-y", "0deg");
      });
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .hero-profile-photo {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    width: 16.875rem;
    height: 16.875rem;
    margin: 0;
    place-items: center;
    border: 2px solid rgb(103 232 249 / 0.7);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(103 232 249 / 0.95), rgb(129 140 248 / 0.85) 48%, rgb(217 70 239 / 0.8));
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 6px rgb(8 47 73 / 0.7),
      0 0 2.5rem rgb(34 211 238 / 0.35);
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    animation: hero-profile-float 5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .hero-profile-photo img {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 108%;
    height: 108%;
    max-width: none;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    transform: translateY(-8%);
  }

  .hero-profile-photo-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -1rem;
    z-index: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(34 211 238 / 0.5), rgb(217 70 239 / 0.4));
    filter: blur(1rem);
  }

  .hero-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 16.875rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .hero-copy .max-w-xl {
    margin-left: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .hero-intro {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero-profile-photo {
      width: min(16.875rem, 75vw);
      height: min(16.875rem, 75vw);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .hero-copy .max-w-xl {
      margin-right: auto;
      margin-left: auto;
    }
  }

  @keyframes hero-profile-float {
